      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. we've been looking at the compaction reports and they seem okay on paper, but the cracks are still showing up in very specific patterns. do you think there could be any external environmental factors or maybe even some kind of localized soil movement we're missing that would cause that specific longitudinal pattern?",
